  "_comment": [
    "Inputs for the cross-language conformance harness (AU-009). Read by BOTH",
    "tests/test_cross_language_golden.py and frontend/src/test/golden.test.ts.",
    "This file is hand-authored on purpose: it is input, not expected output, and",
    "each case exists to reach a named branch. Expected output lives in",
    "expected.tsv and is machine-generated -- never edit that by hand.",
    "",
    "Activities carry only the seven fields the stats functions read. The rest of",
    "the exported activity record (weather, elevation, has_gps) is irrelevant here",
    "and is covered by mappers.test.ts / test_export_records.py."
  ],

